{"unit_id":"kinmat-A__dsh-theme-switch#card-zh","repo":"kinmat-A/dsh-theme-switch","commit":"320edb2601e4ff1d62ea8bb7bf14bb3a8d2c4d67","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 主题切换是一款面向网页客户端的外观管理插件，会在设置的插件皮肤页展示已安装皮肤和官方默认外观。它扫描当前 profile 的依赖与 bundles，并可通过配置补充识别结果；用户可一键启用或停用皮肤，启用一款时自动停用其他皮肤，也可切回官方外观。开关通过 home 层补丁保存并供 DSH 启动流程读取，适合希望在网页设置中集中管理外观的 DSH 用户。需要安装在 web profile 中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:78-120","lib/index.js:201-227","src/client/index.tsx:213-230"]}
{"unit_id":"kinmat-A__dsh-theme-switch#card-en","repo":"kinmat-A/dsh-theme-switch","commit":"320edb2601e4ff1d62ea8bb7bf14bb3a8d2c4d67","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH theme switch adds a Skins tab to web settings and lists detected skins with the official look. It scans profile dependencies and bundles, accepts configured themes, and lets users switch skins or restore the default. Enabling one disables the others, with selections saved in the DSH home patch.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:78-120","lib/index.js:201-227","src/client/index.tsx:213-230"]}
