{"unit_id":"kinmat-A__dsh-theme-switch#feature-1","repo":"kinmat-A/dsh-theme-switch","commit":"320edb2601e4ff1d62ea8bb7bf14bb3a8d2c4d67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 主题切换功能「皮肤检测」：扫描 web profile 的依赖和 bundles，按包名、skin.json 或补丁标记识别皮肤，也可用 themes 配置补充。检测结果显示在设置的皮肤页。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:78-120"]}
{"unit_id":"kinmat-A__dsh-theme-switch#feature-2","repo":"kinmat-A/dsh-theme-switch","commit":"320edb2601e4ff1d62ea8bb7bf14bb3a8d2c4d67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「DSH 主题切换」功能「互斥切换」：在设置的皮肤页点击某个皮肤即可切换；启用目标时其他皮肤停用，再次点击可停用目标。 通过网页设置页的皮肤按钮触发，结果体现在皮肤启用状态中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:201-217"]}
{"unit_id":"kinmat-A__dsh-theme-switch#feature-3","repo":"kinmat-A/dsh-theme-switch","commit":"320edb2601e4ff1d62ea8bb7bf14bb3a8d2c4d67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「DSH 主题切换」功能「恢复官方外观」：选择“官方 DSH 皮肤”会停用所有已识别皮肤；所有皮肤停用时，官方外观标记为当前使用。 通过网页设置页的皮肤按钮触发，结果体现在皮肤启用状态中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:201-227"]}
{"unit_id":"kinmat-A__dsh-theme-switch#feature-4","repo":"kinmat-A/dsh-theme-switch","commit":"320edb2601e4ff1d62ea8bb7bf14bb3a8d2c4d67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「DSH 主题切换」功能「保存切换状态」：切换状态写入 DSH home 下的 cordis.patch.yml；默认目录为 ~/.dsh，也可由 DSH_HOME 指定。 通过网页设置页的皮肤按钮触发，结果体现在皮肤启用状态中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44-55"]}
{"unit_id":"kinmat-A__dsh-theme-switch#caveat-1","repo":"kinmat-A/dsh-theme-switch","commit":"320edb2601e4ff1d62ea8bb7bf14bb3a8d2c4d67","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 主题切换会把皮肤启用状态写入 DSH home 目录中的 cordis.patch.yml，默认位置为 ~/.dsh/cordis.patch.yml；目录可通过 DSH_HOME 修改。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:44-55","lib/index.js:156-199"]}
